  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in the hot pot vessel over medium high heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and stir fry for 1 minute.",
    "Add the Chinese broccoli florets and stir fry for 3 minutes.",
    "Add the soy sauce, salt, and black pepper, and stir fry for 1 minute.",
    "Add the rice vinegar and stir fry for 1 minute.",
    "Sprinkle the sesame seeds over the top of the broccoli.",
    "Transfer the hot pot vessel to the table and serve immediately.",
    "Garnish with chopped scallions.",
    "Serve with steamed rice or noodles if desired."
